# React Conventions

Use React only for **interactive islands** embedded in Astro pages. Static or server-rendered UI belongs in `.astro` files, not React.

## File placement

- `src/components/ui/` — reusable primitives (shadcn-style); reference: @src/components/ui/button.tsx
- `src/components/forms/` — shared fields (`FormField.tsx`); named exports (`export function FormField`)
- `src/components/auth/` — auth islands only (sign-in/up, password toggle, server error, submit)
- `src/components/<feature>/` — feature-specific interactive UI

Import shared code via `@/*` (maps to `src/*`). Do not import from `src/pages/` into components.

## Component shape

- Functional components only; no class components.
- Export **named** exports from `ui/` (`export { Button }`) and `forms/` (`export function FormField`); **default** export for top-level form/page islands (see @src/components/auth/SignInForm.tsx).
- Define props with a `Props` interface or `React.ComponentProps<"element">` extension — no implicit `any`.
- Prefix intentionally unused bindings with `_`.

## Styling

- Tailwind utility classes only; merge conditionals with `cn()` from @src/lib/utils.ts.
- UI variants: use `cva` + `VariantProps` pattern from @src/components/ui/button.tsx — do not invent ad-hoc variant string concatenation.

## Data & auth

- Do not instantiate Supabase in components — use server endpoints (`src/pages/api/`) or props/`serverError` passed from Astro pages.
- Auth forms may POST to `/api/auth/*` routes (see SignInForm pattern); keep validation client-side for UX, server-side for security.

## Icons & accessibility

- Icons: `lucide-react` with `className="size-4"` (or match sibling usage).
- Form fields: associate `label` + `id`, surface errors inline — follow @src/components/forms/FormField.tsx.

## Lint enforcement

React Compiler and hooks rules are errors (@eslint.config.js). Run `npm run lint` after edits; do not disable `react-compiler/react-compiler`.

See @AGENTS.md for repo-wide rules.
